    "question": {
        "text": "How does glucose induce insulin release?",
        "imageIds": []
    },
    "answer": {
        "text": "Closes ATP dependent K+ channels\n\n↑ Glucose\n\n⇒ ↑ Aerobic respiration\n\n⇒ ↑ ATP\n\n⇒ Closure of ATP gated K+ efflux channels\n\n⇒ ↑ Membrane voltage\n\n⇒ Opening of voltage gated Ca2+ channels\n\n⇒ Ca2+ influx\n\n⇒ Exocytosis of insulin\n\n[Image: 28c4167dbda11237db534bb147d389424e132dd3cb19d6a2510d43de183420fe]\n\n[Image: ee3a21f0236259f57dfbafc443864ce27fdd381f11f180a81d4b3fc68e70840f]",
